{
  "description": "Server-initiated sign-out and list resyncs (planned server frames; clients should already handle them). Same step kinds and tracked events as private_signout.json. {\"type\":\"signed_out\",\"reason\":R} (no id, channel or sequence) means the server signed this connection out: private subscriptions are gone, public ones and the socket stay, and a fresh auth on the same socket is accepted. The client drops its held private channels into pending, forgets the token, and emits auth_changed with reason token_expired (R = expired), session_revoked (R = revoked, which ALSO emits auth_lost: once the server sends this frame, a revocation seen by another server instance arrives only this way) or signed_out with code R for any other value (the set may grow). Pending private channels are re-subscribed after the next successful auth, followed by resync {reason: reauth}. deposits.resync and withdrawals.resync (data {}, no sequence) emit resync with reason deposits_resync or withdrawals_resync: refetch that list.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "signed_out_expired",
      "steps": [
        {
          "client": "auth",
          "token": "tok_a"
        },
        {
          "server": {
            "type": "authenticated",
            "user_id": "aaaa0001"
          },
          "reply_to": "auth"
        },
        {
          "client": "subscribe",
          "channels": [
            "orders",
            "ticker:BTC/USDT"
          ]
        },
        {
          "server": {
            "type": "subscribed",
            "channels": [
              "orders",
              "ticker:BTC/USDT"
            ]
          },
          "reply_to": "subscribe"
        },
        {
          "expect_sent": [
            {
              "op": "auth",
              "token": "tok_a"
            },
            {
              "op": "subscribe",
              "channels": [
                "orders",
                "ticker:BTC/USDT"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "expect_events": []
        },
        {
          "server": {
            "type": "signed_out",
            "reason": "expired"
          }
        },
        {
          "expect_sent": []
        },
        {
          "expect_events": [
            {
              "type": "auth_changed",
              "reason": "token_expired",
              "previous_user_id": "aaaa0001",
              "user_id": null,
              "dropped": [
                "orders"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "expect_held": [
            "ticker:BTC/USDT"
          ]
        },
        {
          "expect_token": false
        },
        {
          "client": "auth",
          "token": "tok_a2"
        },
        {
          "server": {
            "type": "authenticated",
            "user_id": "aaaa0001"
          },
          "reply_to": "auth"
        },
        {
          "expect_sent": [
            {
              "op": "auth",
              "token": "tok_a2"
            },
            {
              "op": "subscribe",
              "channels": [
                "orders"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "server": {
            "type": "subscribed",
            "channels": [
              "orders"
            ]
          },
          "reply_to": "subscribe"
        },
        {
          "expect_events": [
            {
              "type": "resync",
              "reason": "reauth"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "expect_held": [
            "orders",
            "ticker:BTC/USDT"
          ]
        },
        {
          "expect_token": true
        }
      ]
    },
